ss=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Boots\"><img alt=\"Steel Boots\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Steel_Boots_d649a4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demonbone Amulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demonbone_Amulet_6db9bf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Golden Legs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Golden_Legs_56cbef.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>PoI Spa (sometimes called DT City) is a large room that is found after passing Hall of the Four Ways and Pits of Inferno Levers. It contains creatures such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Diabolic%20Imp\">Diabolic Imps</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare\">Nightmares</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Defiler\">Defilers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroyer\">Destroyers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellfire%20Fighter\">Hellfire Fighters</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Phantasm\">Phantasms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Torturer\">Dark Torturers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Plaguesmith\">Plaguesmiths</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blightwalker\">Blightwalkers</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devils</a>.\n</p><p>The creatures here, especially Dark Torturers, drop really great loot, which makes this a good place to gain some profit.\n</p></div>","quests":["the-pits-of-inferno-quest"]}